+// Evolving arrays (tsc's EvolvingArrayType): what `let x = []` is while control flow sees elements being pushed. They
+// never leave a flow query: ty_flow_type() gives the final array type. PROTOTYPE: an intrinsic whose alias_args hold
+// the element type
+static char const evolving_name[] = "evolving array";
